Description: automatic subtitle downloader for movie files (NapiProjekt upload support)
 Subnapi is a graphical downloader and uploader of subtitles for
 napiprojekt.pl, opensubtitles.org and napisy24.pl. Subtitles may be
 fetched in many different languages, with automatic matching against
 the local movie file.
 .
 Subnapi is a Linux-only fork of the original QNapi
 (https://github.com/QNapi/qnapi, inactive since 2022). Compared to that
 project, this fork adds NapiProjekt subtitle upload/correction support
 and drops Windows/macOS packaging, which could not be tested on.
